{"id":"nut-root","ord":"a0","title":"nixos-unified-template","desc":"The project folder for github.com/juspay/nixos-unified-template (local clone ~/code/nixos-unified-template): the template strangers copy to start a nixos-unified configuration. No special process — plain GitHub Actions CI, auto-merge on green unless ruled otherwise.","created":"2026-08-28T18:19:33-04:00"}
{"id":"nut-ci-runners","parent":"nut-root","ord":"a0","title":"CI moves to GitHub's standard runners","doing":true,"desc":"The human's ruling 2026-08-28: ci.yaml's `runs-on: ${{ matrix.system }}` used nix system names as runner labels — self-hosted runners the repo does not have, which is why runs landed action_required/failure and nothing green had run on main since May. The fix maps the matrix to hosted runners with the nix system as a separate matrix variable, and makes the workflow self-sufficient on a hosted runner. Amended by the human mid-lane (~18:30): intel mac dropped — the matrix is ubuntu-latest + macos-latest only. The template exists to be copied by strangers, for whom hosted runners are the only thing that works.","created":"2026-08-28T18:19:33-04:00","changed":"2026-08-28T18:44:50-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-grok","brief":"briefs/nut-ci-runners.md","dispatched":"2026-08-28T18:18:00-04:00","merge":"merge-auto","merge-commit":"https://github.com/juspay/nixos-unified-template/commit/10c776cb","merged":"2026-08-28T18:43:00-04:00","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/nixos-unified-template/pull/237","terminal":"9f49038b","tier":"mechanical","worktree":".worktrees/gh-hosted-runners"}}
